# Apple 手动规则
# 用于添加自定义的 Apple 相关规则

# Apple service ownership; outbound routing is selected by the consumer.
DOMAIN,gateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud-content.com
# Store and Apple Music service endpoints are Apple's own services.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-cloudkit.com
DOMAIN,sandbox.itunes-apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN,push.apple.com
# Exact Apple service aliases from the maintained DNS_Global_Apple mapping.
DOMAIN,apple.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN,icloud.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN,mzstatic.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN,icloud-cdn.icloud.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN,ocsp-lb.apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN,ocsp2-lb.apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN,pancake.cdn-apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN,store.apple.com.edgekey.net
